al over the hearts of the transgressors.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"10:75","t":"Then We sent after them Moses and Aaron to Pharaoh and his establishment with Our signs, but they behaved arrogantly and were a criminal people.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"10:76","t":"So when there came to them the truth from Us, they said, \"Indeed, this is obvious magic.\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":76,"sd":null},{"k":"10:77","t":"Moses said, \"Do you say [thus] about the truth when it has come to you? Is this magic? But magicians will not succeed.\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":77,"sd":null},{"k":"10:78","t":"They said, \"Have you come to us to turn us away from that upon which we found our fathers and so that you two may have grandeur in the land? And we are not believers in you.\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":78,"sd":null}],"juz":11,"hizb":22,"surahs":[10],"sajdah":false}